      <activity id="865be7c8-2a2b-52b6-8a95-e7694809189d" activityNameId="78bdde1d-ef06-554b-a2c2-dc5925c9a6a6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Blast furnace slag cement, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Blast furnace slag cement, at plant
Part of total Swiss cement production: 2%. Composition: gypsum 4%, blast furnace slag 50%, clinker 46%;
Synonyms: Zement, Portlandzement, cement, portland cement, CEM III B 32.5; 
UUID: 2a2632dc-5aee-3802-9957-d0c475216e4a
includes the manufacturing processes mixing and grinding, internal processes (transport, etc.) and infrastructure. No administration and no packing is included. Special inputs: blast furnace slag, not balanced as it is waste from iron production.
Location: For some exchanges RER-modules have been used as proxy
Technology: Typical technology for Swiss production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 53766.06 t/a
Sampling: most data measured by all Swiss plants (8 plants) 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2a2632dc-5aee-3802-9957-d0c475216e4a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
